{"version":1,"content":"<p>古洞北發展來勢洶洶，昔日的醬園和民居集中地，大部分土地已被夷為平地。悅和醬園、鉅利醬園仍舊留守，不少家園都已被推土機鏟平⋯⋯</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><figcaption><strong><em>古洞的房屋大都已被拆毀，四處沙塵滾滾，工人在拆屋、平整土地，準備施工。三級歷史建築仁華盧，是目前仍然完好的建築物。這一天，屋主楊先生正好回到仁華盧。這裏是四合院建築，1933 年由印尼華僑楊雁友所建，在 1945 年曾做私塾，為古洞村村民提供教育。</em></strong></figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"672\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E7%9F%B3%E4%BB%94%E5%B6%BA02-20261001yik-YIK_6227_1a-1024x672.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption><strong><em>古洞現時無處不地盤，道路和工地，只是一個水馬之隔，到新界地方踩單車人士，沿途變成地盤風光。</em></strong></figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"657\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E7%9F%B3%E4%BB%94%E5%B6%BA03-20261001yik-YIK_6615_2a-1024x657.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption><strong><em>居民大都已遷走，有居民回家執拾，懷念一下在舊居的歲月。<br/></em></strong></figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"702\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E7%9F%B3%E4%BB%94%E5%B6%BA04-20261001yik-YIK_6209_1a-1024x702.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption><strong><em>1940 年已搬入古洞的調源醬油糖薑食品廠（左），多年來曾生產豉油、蠔油、白酒、蓮蓉等，如今已人去樓空，招牌也被拆下。<br/></em></strong></figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E7%9F%B3%E4%BB%94%E5%B6%BA05-20261001yik-YIK_6233_1a-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption><strong><em>從舊有的古洞菜站直入，舊有的房屋陸續被拆毀。</em></strong></figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"694\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E7%9F%B3%E4%BB%94%E5%B6%BA06-20261001yik-YIK_6375_1a-1024x694.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption>一片沙泥地上，仍有少量房屋暫未被拆毀。</figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"695\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E7%9F%B3%E4%BB%94%E5%B6%BA07-20261001yik-YIK_6381_1a-1024x695.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption>兩層高的房屋，被拆了一半，露出鋼筋、樓梯等結構。</figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E7%9F%B3%E4%BB%94%E5%B6%BA08-20261001yik-YIK_6386_1a-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption><strong><em>推土機下，是一片頹垣敗瓦和鋼筋。</em></strong></figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E7%9F%B3%E4%BB%94%E5%B6%BA09-20261001yik-YIK_6394_1a-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption><strong><em>部分鐵皮屋仍未被拆。</em></strong></figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"688\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E7%9F%B3%E4%BB%94%E5%B6%BA10-20261001yik-YIK_6498_2a-1024x688.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption><strong><em>人去樓空，留下了昔日的裝飾。</em></strong></figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"678\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E7%9F%B3%E4%BB%94%E5%B6%BA11-20261001yik-YIK_6505_1a-1024x678.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption><strong><em>人去樓空，留下了昔日的裝飾。</em></strong></figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"693\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E7%9F%B3%E4%BB%94%E5%B6%BA12-20261001yik-YIK_6540_1a-1024x693.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption><strong><em>昔日的家園、廠房，變成地盤。</em></strong></figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E7%9F%B3%E4%BB%94%E5%B6%BA13-20261001yik-YIK_6562_1a-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"666\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E7%9F%B3%E4%BB%94%E5%B6%BA1420261001yik-YIK_6566_1a-1024x666.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"716\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/%E7%9F%B3%E4%BB%94%E5%B6%BA1520261001yik-DJI_20261001152033_0185_D_1a-1024x716.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption><strong><em>古洞曾是港產醬園集中地，被綠色圍網包住的地方，曾為李錦記所擁有。</em></strong></figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T17:18:27.704822+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":495,"images":14,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-empty"}}